# E1 streamyfin/streamyfin ., commit 9942b93dc1d8ee1e795e58484f82a70c879c3a31
# Hand-derived from the app/ tree (80 files) with Expo Router rules: (group) segments stripped, index -> parent, [x] -> :x, [...x] -> *;
# _layout, +html (app/+html.tsx) are not screens; app/+not-found.tsx -> catch-all /* at app/. page.tsx is NOT special in Expo Router (literal "page" segment;
# the app navigates to "/settings/appearance/page", app/(auth)/(tabs)/(home)/settings.tsx:100). settings.tv.tsx merges with settings.tsx (react-native-tvos).
# The group array (home,libraries,search,favorites,watchlists)/x yields one URL per file. Files colliding on one URL count once:
# / ((tabs)/index, (custom-links)/index, (favorites)/index, (home)/index, (libraries)/index, (search)/index, (settings)/index, (watchlists)/index)
# and /:libraryId ((libraries)/[libraryId].tsx = (watchlists)/[watchlistId].tsx).
